Task Guide:

Task make_2_lvl1:
Propose a retrosynthesis route to synthesize the molecule with SMILES COC([C@]12CC=CC[C@H]1C(C2)=O)=O. The route must have at least 1 reactions.  You should use the template/s ['1914397'] in this order.

Required submission format:
Submit a JSON object representing the retrosynthesis route. It must follow the same JSON format as the next example: `{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "CO",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": "template_x",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "BrC"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "[OH-]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}`.



You must think what to do next. You can use some of the tools available in the system.

When you think that the task is completed, you can submit the answer.
For that, answer with: "Final Answer: <your answer>". It is very important to follow this format.

The route has been verified and is valid. It meets all the requirements:
1. It uses the specified template (1914397)
2. It has at least 1 reaction
3. The format follows the required JSON structure
4. The retrosynthetic step has been verified to be valid

Therefore, I can now submit the final answer:

Final Answer: {
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "COC([C@]12CC=CC[C@H]1C(C2)=O)=O",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": "1914397",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "C=CC=C"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "COC(=O)C1=CC(=O)C1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
